        Mini Lele Featured Products
        ===========================
        Static grid of 8 placeholder product cards. For real eCommerce,
        replace this snippet with Odoo's built-in `website_sale.s_products`
        or `website_sale.products_categories_collapsing` — they pull live
        products from product.template. This snippet is editorial.
    -->
